# Line endings are part of what gets stored in the database: a migration pushed
# from a CRLF checkout stores CRLF inside function bodies, and `supabase db diff`
# then reports every one of them as changed on an LF machine. Pin everything to
# LF so a checkout looks the same on every OS (and `deno fmt --check` agrees).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
